# Local captures created by state-pull.
/out/
# Capture boundary (committed summaries, local-only raw).
# See conventions.md. Raw pull dirs never commit; the _sample
# self-test fixture is the one committed exception.
observations/*/pull-*/
observations/*/latest
!observations/_sample/latest
# Credential store: the workspace device.cdb never commits.
# The star covers centrs siblings too: .bak.* snapshots and init temps.
*.cdb*
